<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed lower in heavy trading Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 13.04 to 5966.77.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 1.23 to 373.51.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.13.</p>
<p>Losers beat gainers 1361 to 1014.</p>
<p>Volume was 434,661,820, compared with 380,740,160 Monday.</p>
